<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (2. The Abundant Harvest: With Decentragri's support, farmers cultivate high-quality Produce, be it succulent fruits, nutritious vegetables, or staple grains like rice and corn. This produce isn't just a commodity; it represents the farmer's hard work, the land's potential, and the sustainable practices fostered by the ecosystem.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
279 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (3. The Conscious Buyer: The abundant, high-quality produce then reaches the Buyer or Consumer. These are individuals who value transparency, fair trade, and sustainable sourcing. Decentragri connects them directly to the source. Through the platform, buyers can discover farm-fresh products, knowing their purchase directly supports the farmers and their sustainable practices. They are no longer just consumers; they become active participants in a fairer food system.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
