<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (4. The Transformative NFT: This is where the magic of Web3 truly empowers the cycle. The NFT \(Non-Fungible Token\) represents the core mechanism for transparency.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
