<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 686 0 R
/E (For staple crops like rice, NFTs can represent a share of the future yield from a specific farm plot. Buyers purchase these tokens, financing the farmer's planting and cultivation costs. These NFTs not only secure the assets but also serve as verifiable, immutable records, allowing buyers to see the journey of their product or asset, ensuring trust and traceability.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
283 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (5. Completing the Cycle: Funding and Sustainability: The funds generated from the sale of these NFTs flow directly back to the Farmer. This provides them with much-needed capital for operations, expansion, and adopting even more sustainable methods. It breaks the cycle of poverty and limited access to finance. This continuous flow of resources, powered by Decentragri's blockchain infrastructure, ensures that farmers are fairly compensated, continually improve their practices, and can keep cultivating high-quality produce.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
